license: MIT
license-url: https://github.com/
abstract: >-
  Measurement data, analysis code and documentation for a study of the energy cost of
  encrypted-video Key Quality Indicator monitoring at the network edge. Covers six model
  families for stalling detection and buffer-health estimation, four traffic views, offline and
  live inference workloads, multi-stream capture under load, and an additive stage-cost energy
  model, measured as whole-device AC energy on a Raspberry Pi 4 and a Jetson Orin Nano Super.
keywords:
  - video streaming
  - quality of experience
  - key quality indicator prediction
  - energy efficiency
  - energy model
  - edge computing
  - machine learning
